  <p><font size=4>(Ya muhammad, ya basheer, ya nazeer-o-ya mahmood) x2</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Ya mukarram ya mu'azzam ya muqaddam ya haadi</p> <p>Ya jaleel-o-ya jameel, ya mateen-o-ya taha</p> <p>Hai tuhi aasra ay hussain ke nana</p> <p>(Ya rasoolallah) x2</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Hamne darbar-e-zehra mei ki iltijaa</li>
    <p>Aur kabhi bint-e-zehra se mangi dua</p>
    <p>(Hamne ghazi ki chokhat pe sajda kiya) x2</p>
    <p>phir jabee(n) tere dar par jjhukali</p>
    <p>(tera dar hai jahaa me misali) x2</p>
    <p>(Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad) x2 (sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali) x2</p>
    <p>Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali</p>
    <li>Hai sakhiyo(n) to sara gharana tera</li>
    <p>Do jahaa(n) pe khula hai khazana tera</p>
    <p>(Parh raha hai qasida zamaana tera) x2</p>
    <p>tune sabki musibat hai ttali</p>
    <p>(meri jholi abhitak hai khali) x2</p>
    <p>(Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad) x2 (sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali) x2</p>
    <p>Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali</p>
    <li>Jistarha se saji mehfile panjatan</li>
    <p>Tu muhammed tera bhai khayber shikan</p>
    <p>(aur khayber shikan ka pisar hai hassan) x2</p>
    <p>de hassan ke baradar ka sadqa</p>
    <p>(jisne sajde me ghardan kataali) x2</p>
    <p>(Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad) x2 (sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali) x2</p>
    <p>Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali</p>
    <li>Tu masiha hai humko dawaa chahiye</li>
    <p>Maut ttaljaye gar tu ishara kare</p>
    <p>(hum faqiro(n) ko tujhse ye nisbat bhi hai) x2</p>
    <p>hum faqiro(n) ke kapre hai kaale</p>
    <p>(tere khandhe pe kamli hai kaali) x2</p>
    <p>(Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad) x2 (sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali) x2</p>
    <p>Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali</p>
    <li>Har hussaini bahan ki hai ye iltija</li>
    <p>Tere dar se na mayoos koyi gaya</p>
    <p>(dede asghar ka sadqa habibe khuda) x2</p>
    <p>ye hai un bibiyo(n) ki sadaaye</p>
