    <p>(Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad) x2 (sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali) x2</p>
    <p>Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali</p>
    <li>Ye jo kamsin hussaini pareshan hai</li>
    <p>Farshe majlis pe ashghar ke mehmaan hai</p>
    <p>(haa(n) ye agle zamaane ke irfaan hai) x2</p>
    <p>hai ye awno muhammed ke zakir</p>
    <p>(tu inhe umr de khizr waali) x2</p>
    <p>(Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad) x2 (sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali) x2</p>
    <p>Bharde jholi meri ya muhammad sab hussaini hai tujhse sawali</p>
